OL,3,GNEWSAFour fans arrested at
OL,4,ABradford-Huddersfield derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour football fans have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter trouble before and during
OL,8,FSaturday's West Yorkshire derby between
OL,9,FBradford City and Huddersfield Town at
OL,10,FMbanq Valley Parade.
OL,12,FWest Yorkshire Police said a
OL,13,F45-year-old man had been detained on
OL,14,Fsuspicion of assaulting an emergency
OL,15,Fworker, while a 23-year-old man was
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of a public order
OL,17,Foffence.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
