OL,3,GNEWSAFour fans arrested at
OL,4,ABradford-Huddersfield derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man was also arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of being drunk and
OL,8,Fdisorderly, while a 52-year-old man was
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of assaulting a
OL,10,Fsteward.
OL,12,FOfficers said three of the arrests took
OL,13,Fplace outside the ground before the
OL,14,FLeague One fixture kicked off at 12:30
OL,15,FGMT, with one taking place during the
OL,16,Fgame.
